---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PageHero } from '@/components/layout/PageHero';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Synerge Health"
  description="How Synerge Health handles information submitted through this website."
  currentPath="/privacy"
>
  <main class="flex-1">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Legal & Governance"
      title="Privacy Policy"
      description="Last updated: 14 October 2026. This policy explains how information submitted through this website is handled."
    />

    <section class="py-24 bg-[#060B09]">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-sm text-[#C2D1CB] leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by Synerge Health Innovation Hub Limited in Nigeria. “Synerge Health,”
          “we,” and “us” refer to that company. For privacy questions or requests, contact
          <a class="text-[#2BE0B0] underline" href="mailto:hello@synergehealth.com">hello@synergehealth.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          If you submit a founder application, investor enquiry, or contact message, we collect the information
          you enter, such as your name, email address, organisation, and message or application details. Newsletter
          sign-up collects your email address and subscription status. The unsubscribe credential is stored as a
          one-way hash. Cloudflare may process network information, including your IP address, to operate this
          website and apply submission rate limits.
        </p>
        <p>
          Do not submit patient-identifying information, medical records, or other sensitive personal information
          through these forms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">How we use information</h2>
        <p>
          We use submissions to respond to enquiries, assess founder applications and investor requests, administer
          newsletter subscriptions, protect the forms from abuse, and maintain the operation and security of this
          website. Newsletter subscriptions take effect when submitted; each subscription email includes an
          unsubscribe link.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">Service providers and sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Website hosting, database storage, and form processing are provided through Cloudflare. Resend is used
          to deliver submission notifications and newsletter emails. This website also requests typefaces from
          Google Fonts; when your browser loads them, Google may receive standard request information such as
          your IP address and browser details. Information is shared with these providers as needed to provide
          the relevant service, and may be disclosed where required by law or to protect rights and security.
          We do not sell information submitted through these forms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Form submissions may be included in notification emails sent to our team. The retention periods below
          apply to records in our Cloudflare D1 database; copies held by Resend or in recipient mailboxes are
          subject to those services&rsquo; and mailbox administrators&rsquo; retention practices. A deletion from
          our database does not automatically delete an email copy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">How long we retain information</h2>
        <p>
          Founder applications and investor enquiries are scheduled for deletion 12 months after submission.
          Contact messages are scheduled for deletion after 6 months. Newsletter email addresses are retained
          until you unsubscribe; a valid unsubscribe removes the subscription record. Operational email-delivery
          records in D1 are deleted with their related submission or subscription. These periods may be extended
          where needed to comply with law or resolve a dispute. The database schedule does not control copies
          already sent to our team&rsquo;s email inboxes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">Your choices and requests</h2>
        <p>
          You may unsubscribe using the link in a newsletter email. You may also contact us to request access to,
          correction of, or deletion of information you submitted. We will respond subject to applicable legal
          requirements and may need to verify your request.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-[#F8FAFC]">Security and changes</h2>
        <p>
          We use service-provider and technical controls intended to protect submitted information. No internet
          transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure. We may update this policy as our
          practices change; the date above indicates when it was last revised.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
